       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 371-53
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7686168"
    >
Superseding clause.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7686168" data-guid="7686168"></div>
        <div id="questions-7686168" data-guid="7686168" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7686168_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">Nothing in this article contained shall be deemed to limit the powers and jurisdiction of the Water Power and Control Commission of the State of New York.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
      </div>
  </div>

            </div>
          </div>
        </main>
